      "content": "I understand that it seems overwhelming and even hopeless sometimes, but it's okay to feel this way. This feeling, however, doesn't have to define you or your future. There are people, movements, and resources committed to making a change. You don't have to face this alone; reaching out and connecting with those who share your concerns can bring new perspectives and strength. You're advocating for the world you want to see; it's a courageous act in itself.",
      "source": "target",
